@startuml container-view
!include _theme.iuml
left to right direction

actor "Operator" as Operator
actor "Automation" as Automation

rectangle "Trusted workstation or CI runner" as Runtime {
  component "Node.js process\nOctoform CLI / ESM library" as Octoform
  file "octoform.yml\nand imports" as Config
  file "Declared seed files" as Seeds
  rectangle "Process environment\nGITHUB_TOKEN / GH_TOKEN" as Token
}

cloud "GitHub.com" as GitHub {
  component "REST API" as REST
  database "Repository and\norganization state" as State
}

Operator --> Octoform : commands and confirmation
Automation --> Octoform : read-only or protected command
Config --> Octoform : desired policy
Seeds --> Octoform : create-if-missing content
Token --> Octoform : authentication in memory
Octoform --> REST : HTTPS requests through Octokit
REST --> State : read / permitted mutation
REST --> Octoform : observed state and API evidence
Octoform --> Operator : plans, findings and outcomes
Octoform --> Automation : console report and exit code
@enduml
